            "review_title": "Review at Tiem Ba Khoang Hidden Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "bobwyles\n10 contributions\n0\nMust try best cocktails in Ben Tre!!!!!!!!!\nJul 2023 • Solo\nAlthough the cocktail bar is modest and the architecture is unpretentious, going here provides an inexplicable sense of pleasure. The owner and team are extremely nice, and they are especially interested in the taste and sensations of their clients in order to make extremely personalized branded drinks. The bar offers a fantastic view of the river, yet the pricing is fairly reasonable. If you are a fan of cocktails,  skipping Tiem Ba Khoang bar will be a mistake.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 24, 2023",
